  "title": "Classic Hamburger Pie",
  "description": "This hamburger pie features ground beef and onion topped with mashed potatoes and Cheddar cheese for an easy-to-make family-favorite comfort dish.",
  "authors": [
    "rademarco"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:58:29-04:00",
